WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:04.166
- Yo, I’m kind of worried about the volcano. 
Did you see how many Titans tested positive for lava?

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:07.708
- Ignore all that man. It's the freakin' QUARTER-SEASON CARNIVAL!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.666
- Yo, what up I got a quick pass. Much love. 

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:15.750
- WEEE!! I LOVE TO FEEL THE AIR THROUGH MY HAIR PUFF. 

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:17.333
- Hey, guys, is this how you slide?

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:19.875
Cool! I keep winning by doing wacky s--t!

00:00:20.041 --> 00:00:22.416
- Don't worry, loser still gets a prize.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.291
- Whoa, I don't want that.

00:00:23.416 --> 00:00:26.750
- I think I could do this with better coaching, but at this point, I’m not sure.

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:29.375
- I’m Danny Dimes, and I shoot like this!

00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:32.541
- Step right up to the Tunnel of Jordan Love!

00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:34.666
A ride that’s more scared of me than I am of it. 

00:00:34.875 --> 00:00:38.000
- So back when I was playing in Denver...wait, I was never on the Broncos. 

00:00:38.208 --> 00:00:39.500
How was I never on the Broncos?

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.708
- ♪♪♪ A starter goes above and beyond ♪♪♪ 

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.666
♪♪♪ to make sure there’s no greater bond. ♪♪♪ 

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.291
- BOOOOOOO.
- Oh Boooooo.
- [Carson, sighing].

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.250
- Yes, I fit. The bar is just too high. If you could lower the bar for me?

00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:55.291
- [Announcer:] Do not fumble with the bar.

00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:57.458
- CAN EVERYONE STOP QUESTIONING MY DECISION-MAK—

